# ─── Audited third-party repositories (2.2 GB) ────────────────────────────────
# QM, Hermes Agent and Ruflo were cloned for the source-level audit. They are other
# people's code with their own history and licences — never commit them.
# Recreate with the pinned commits recorded in research/notes/01-git-forensics.md:
#   git clone --filter=blob:none https://github.com/yc-software/qm.git
#   git clone --filter=blob:none https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent.git
#   git clone --filter=blob:none https://github.com/ruvnet/ruflo.git
research/repos/

# ─── Hands-on install artifacts (1.2 GB) ──────────────────────────────────────
# node_modules, venvs and workspaces created while driving the audited systems.
research/runs/

# ─── Dependencies / build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ─── Runtime state — never source ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Event-log databases, WAL/SHM sidecars, workspace shadow repos.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
.harness/
shadow.git/
*shadow.git/

# ─── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Credentials are passed by environment variable only. Nothing here should ever exist.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
secrets.json

# ─── Scratch / editor / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_*.mjs
_*.json
_*.md
*.tmp
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# npm pack output — build artifact, never committed
*.tgz
